  "assessment_scope": "workflow-final-verification, governed-final, VP1-final-readiness for 2026-09-15-skill-simplification; complete original-base change through 9e586773d1008ec8c0ee20ccbc98494b8c7c0d8a, all19 skills and140 canonical package files, SKL-SR-30–32 and applicable retained requirements, TG01–06/TG-FINAL01–02, exact Git/PR readiness. This is a separate assessment after final Code Review, not an external PR action or release approval.",
  "change_id": "2026-09-15-skill-simplification",
  "changes": [
    "Implement and Code Review present task/authority before independently selected complete local recording procedures; validators and meaningful negative tests support the two approved equivalent layouts.",
    "Plan, Proposal Review, Explore and Learn remove specific repeated instructions. Constitution respects project-selected authority and names route. Eleven other skills retain their justified specialist contracts.",
    "CI maintenance restores nine intended assembly names and disjoint selection/resource order, with unknown-value and fenced-example regression protection. Owning Design and Delivery amendment precede this correction.",
    "All19 dispositions and full Codex/Claude package composition are reconciled. Advisory provenance remains recoverable in Git; FU015–018 remain open for broader adoption."
  ],
